.51669836 0.6583131 0.24366198 0.1501881 0.80439085 -0.16105098 0.011128932 0.5884628 0.77304965 0.54262626 -0.19401886 0.66081685 0.04697459 0.8041494 0.6982975\n16 1\n0.9814956 0.8053132 0.5269977 -0.8047956 -1.6299891 0.80752444 -0.8163326 -0.6561919 0.8894982 0.78555495 1.0655055 -0.47944012 1.1637385 -0.3714269 0.85063654 1.0498714\n0.40419745\n</code></pre>\n\n<p><code>inputs.txt</code>:</p>\n\n<pre><code>30.7 3.864 3.866 3.867 3.864\n</code></pre>\n\n<p>Thanks for yours time!</p>\n",
